\" class=\"tpow-dropdown-item\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/16037\"><span>System Operator Consultations</span></a>\n              </li>\n                      <li class=\"nav-item tpow-dropdown\">\n                <a href=\"/system-operator/system-operator-customer-portal\" class=\"tpow-dropdown-item\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/16185\"><span>System Operator Customer Portal</span></a>\n              </li>\n      </ul>\n</div>\n                  </li>\n                                              <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                                <a href=\"/resources\" class=\"nav-link\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"resources\"><span>Resources</span></a>\n                  </li>\n            </ul>\n\n      \n  </div>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n      </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"no-header\">\n        <div class=\"pattern-background-container no-sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"pattern\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <a id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>\n    \n    \n      \n      <div class=\"page__content col-12\">\n        <a id=\"page-content\" tab-index=\"-1\"></a>\n          <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"block block--tpow-content block--system-main\">\n\n  \n    \n\n            <article class=\"node homepage homepage--full\">\n  \n  \n\n      <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"row homepage__hero\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12\">\n            \n\n\n  \n\n\n  <h1  class=\"page-title\">\n                  Empowering our energy future\n            </h1>\n\n\n\n\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-hero-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Delivering the renewable, electrified, low-carbon economy set out in&nbsp;Whakamana i Te Mauri Hiko</p></div>\n      \n          <p>\n      <a href=\"/about-us/our-strategy\">Our strategy</a>\n  </p>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n          \n<div class=\"renewables-gauge\">\n  <div id=\"renewable-pgen-gauge-solid\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"renewables-updated renewables-update-time\">\n    <h3>% Renewables</h3>\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"update-text\">(as at)</span>: <time><span class=\"update-time\"></span></time>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ajax-progress\"><span></span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-graph-link field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item\"><a href=\"/system-operator/live-system-and-market-data\">More Live Data</a></div>\n      \n</div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"homepage__tiles\">\n        <div class=\"row gy-4\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-xl-3\">\n      <article class=\"node page page--tile tile\">\n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"tile-img-wrapper\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-page-icon field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/homepage_tile/public/page-icons/2023/08/What%20we%20do%202.jpg?VersionId=4if_W3s5UrlvIqHmEy4nWX1P4hmFxwE3&amp;itok=rFrptooa\" width=\"564\" height=\"250\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n    <h2>\n      <a href=\"/about-us/what-we-do\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>What we do</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n      <p class=\"field__item summary\">Transpower holds a unique position in the New Zealand energy sector as both National Grid owner and System Operator.</p>\n\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"icon-revealing-arrow\"></div>\n</article>\n\n    </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-xl-3\">\n      <article class=\"node landing-page landing-page--tile tile\">\n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"tile-img-wrapper\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-page-icon field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/homepage_tile/public/page-icons/2025/04/Connection%20web%20tile.jpg?VersionId=FKw_Oq0eHgqGRKPkYhFH2wpyEG0O6CjA&amp;itok=FV_YVdxO\" width=\"564\" height=\"250\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n    <h2>\n      <a href=\"/connections\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Connections</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n      <p class=\"field__item summary\">We\u2019re working at pace to connect new generation, storage and load to increase reliable electricity supply for all New Zealanders.</p>\n\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"icon-revealing-arrow\"></div>\n</article>\n\n    </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-xl-3\">\n      <article class=\"node page page--tile tile\">\n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"tile-img-wrapper\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-page-icon field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/homepage_tile/public/page-icons/2024/08/Lake%20Pukaki_0.jpg?VersionId=90Zcu0Yk9vNT6hbU6PjMPgEb1EE1hX44&amp;itok=axgUHxOj\" width=\"564\" height=\"250\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n    <h2>\n      <a href=\"/system-operator/security-supply\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Security of supply</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n      <p class=\"field__item summary\">In our system operator role, we work closely with industry and government to understand whether there is enough electricity to power New Zealand now and into the future. </p>\n\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"icon-revealing-arrow\"></div>\n</article>\n\n    </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-xl-3\">\n      <article class=\"node landing-page landing-page--tile tile\">\n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"tile-img-wrapper\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-page-icon field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/homepage_tile/public/page-icons/2026/02/education%20web%20tile.jpg?VersionId=LD7L0iOWr_fI0QOkO6B8Hfmc9PT8xjvQ&amp;itok=ZBRFM6mz\" width=\"564\" height=\"250\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n    <h2>\n      <a href=\"/educational-resources\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Educational resources</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n      <p class=\"field__item summary\">Ever wondered how there\u2019s always electricity when you turn on a light or charge your device?</p>\n\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"icon-revealing-arrow\"></div>\n</article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"homepage__news\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div>\n          <h2>Latest news</h2> <span>|</span> <a href=\"/news\">View All</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"views-element-container\">\n<div class=\"view js-view-dom-id-8eb137bcc335eb3aecdd03c6c308a0860d7a03ba3fda03d3066be0b020467577 view-latest-news\">\n       \n        \n        \n        \n            <div class=\"view-content\">\n        <div class=\"views-view-grid horizontal cols-12 clearfix\">\n            <div class=\"row gy-3 gy-md-5 mb-3 mb-md-5\">\n                  <div class=\"col-md-6 col-12\"><article class=\"node news-article news-article--tile\">\n  <div class=\"image\">\n    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-hero-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/news_card/public/2026-06/HVDC%20Cables_A748632_LR.jpg?VersionId=7rM8RoN57fGNqbFm3Tr2FRh7Dhl7kOK3&amp;itok=bLamZ1iv\" width=\"642\" height=\"470\" alt=\"Oteranga Bay\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n\n  <div  class=\"content\">\n    <p class=\"date\">29 Jun 2026</p>\n    \n    <h2 class=\"title\">\n      <a href=\"/news/transpower-secures-cable-supply-cook-strait-electricity-link-upgrade\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Transpower secures cable supply for Cook Strait electricity link upgrade</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n    \n\n      <p class=\"field__item summary\">Transpower has confirmed a contract with specialist global cable supplier Prysmian to manufacture and install four new undersea electricity cables.</p>\n\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n                  <div class=\"col-md-6 col-12\"><article class=\"node news-article news-article--tile\">\n  <div class=\"image\">\n    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-hero-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/news_card/public/2025-11/Takapu%20plantingDJI_0368_LR%201.jpg?VersionId=fwXWCMB2B2aKdkRmd3y4qK1NlGgrplag&amp;itok=TyZ1XQmk\" width=\"642\" height=\"470\" alt=\"Transpower substation and transmission lines overlooked by lush, rolling green hills\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n\n  <div  class=\"content\">\n    <p class=\"date\">29 Jun 2026</p>\n    \n    <h2 class=\"title\">\n      <a href=\"/news/transpower-releases-202627-statement-corporate-intent\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span> Transpower releases 2026/27 Statement of Corporate Intent</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n    \n\n    \n\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n                  <div class=\"col-md-6 col-12\"><article class=\"node news-article news-article--tile\">\n  <div class=\"image\">\n    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-hero-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/news_card/public/2026-06/Insights.png?VersionId=AP3yNAWVwBkUkVAh8zCXVQIr0BGDIWZU&amp;itok=3ogRKXnA\" width=\"642\" height=\"470\" alt=\"The cover image for Te Kanapu&#039;s insights paper\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n\n  <div  class=\"content\">\n    <p class=\"date\">23 Jun 2026</p>\n    \n    <h2 class=\"title\">\n      <a href=\"/news/insights-paper-zeroes-lowest-cost-generation-mix-meet-new-demand\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Insights paper zeroes in on the lowest-cost generation mix to meet new demand</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n    \n\n      <p class=\"field__item summary\">A new insights paper from Transpower\u2019s Te Kanapu programme has been released as part of its work to develop a grid blueprint for 2050. </p>\n\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n                  <div class=\"col-md-6 col-12\"><article class=\"node news-article news-article--tile\">\n  <div class=\"image\">\n    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-hero-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.transpower.co.nz/public/styles/news_card/public/2026-06/HVDC%20Cables_A748499_LR.jpg?VersionId=hyJSbTmwTNQKmSOV6rgVxJpc12Dz18C2&amp;itok=5rETUjtg\" width=\"642\" height=\"470\" alt=\"Oteranga Bay\" class=\"img-fluid\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n\n  <div  class=\"content\">\n    <p class=\"date\">18 Jun 2026</p>\n    \n    <h2 class=\"title\">\n      <a href=\"/news/transpower-welcomes-commerce-commission-approval-cook-strait-cable-investment\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Transpower welcomes Commerce Commission approval for Cook Strait cable investment</span>\n</a>\n    </h2>\n    \n\n      <p class=\"field__item summary\">Transpower welcomes the Commerce Commission\u2019s final decision today to approve its $1.1 billion investment in New Zealand\u2019s High Voltage Direct Current (HVDC) inter-island electricity link.</p>\n\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n              </div>\n      </div>\n\n      </div>\n      \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        </div>\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"row homepage__media\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5\">\n            \n\n\n  \n\n\n  <h2  class=\"page-title\">\n                  Whakamana i Te Mauri Hiko t\u016b mai Aotearoa\n            </h2>\n\n\n\n\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-media-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Our core purpose is to empower the energy future for New Zealand \u2013 a future that delivers a net-zero carbon economy and a reliable and secure electricity system.&nbsp;</p></div>\n      \n          <ul class=\"list-inline media-links\">\n      <li  class=\"list-inline-item mt-0 mb-3\">\n      <a href=\"/about-us/who-we-are/our-people\" class=\"link-pill\">Meet our people</a>\n    </li>\n      <li  class=\"list-inline-item mt-0 mb-3\">\n      <a href=\"https://careers.transpower.co.nz/search\" class=\"link-pill\">Vacancies</a>\n    </li>\n      <li  class=\"list-inline-item mt-0 mb-3\">\n      <a href=\"/about-us/careers-transpower\" class=\"link-pill\">Working at Transpower</a>\n    </li>\n      <li  class=\"list-inline-item mt-0 mb-3\">\n      <a href=\"/about-us/careers-transpower/graduate-programme-and-internships/about-our-graduate-programme\" class=\"link-pill\">Graduate programme</a>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-media-item field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">\n<div class=\"media media--type-remote-video media--view-mode-default\">\n  \n  \n            \n            <div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9 field field--name-field-media-oembed-video field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item\"><iframe src=\"https://www.transpower.co.nz/media/oembed?url=https%3A//www.youtube.com/watch%3Fv%3DA6EKGFegHyY%26t%3D6s&amp;max_width=0&amp;max_height=0&amp;hash=VN2d6_T67rbkYyAzCkfmpEWmR7IJVF1sn4IdK1XrMyI\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" class=\"media-oembed-content\" loading=\"eager\" title=\"Transpower - A great place to work.\"></iframe>\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n</div>\n      \n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-media-content 